    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "2ef46dc10916e3458eb00b3cbb20aac34fa2087c3a6c993a0037f8ca0f90e9a0",
      "target": "你花在终端里的时间，会比花在任何编辑器里的时间都多：运行训练、监控 GPU、跟踪日志末尾的更新、建立远程 SSH 会话、管理环境。每一种 AI 工作流都会用到 Shell（命令解释器）。在这里操作慢，处处都会慢。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "a6d157fce245ca6b8803ff508375d9603c4659784f450388acedec3a3a3d4dcb",
      "target": "本课介绍 AI 工作中真正用得上的终端技能。不讲 Unix 历史，也不深入讲解 Bash 脚本编写，只讲你需要的内容。\n"
    },
    {
