      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "66f49f880a90161afa3bf92f1c444e0af32dface71d97d96208aacea4f7badd0",
      "target": "需要掌握的基本操作：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: Know your shell"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0037",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: Know your shell"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "981a4164d737f12738c5747fe2e1e8b416d9062cce79753e467ab988c65e0c3e",
      "target": "```bash\n# Move around\ncd ~/projects/ai-engineering-from-scratch\npwd\nls -la\n\n# History search (most useful shortcut you'll learn)\n# Ctrl+R then type part of a previous command\n# Press Ctrl+R again to cycle through matches\n\n# Clear terminal\nclear   # or Ctrl+L\n\n# Cancel a running command\n# Ctrl+C\n\n# Suspend a running command (resume with fg)\n# Ctrl+Z\n```\n"
    },
    {
