      "target": "### 步骤 2：管道与重定向\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "339c54affbb74810ff19b0e50b971bbf7a286764af4ff7bb49036965416fb062",
      "target": "管道把多个命令连接起来。你可以借此处理日志、过滤输出、串联工具。这些操作会经常用到。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0043",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "f6dd50cbfe2c9bcb48205103ec9350f9adc8762fff6942ed97094a35da2b122a",
      "target": "```bash\n# Count how many times \"loss\" appears in a log\ncat train.log | grep \"loss\" | wc -l\n\n# Extract just the loss values from training output\ngrep \"loss:\" train.log | awk '{print $NF}' > losses.txt\n\n# Watch a log file update in real time, filtering for errors\ntail -f train.log | grep --line-buffered \"ERROR\"\n\n# Sort experiments by final accuracy\ngrep \"final_accuracy\" results/*.log | sort -t= -k2 -n -r\n\n# Redirect stdout and stderr to separate files\npython train.py > output.log 2> errors.log\n\n# Redirect both to the same file\npython train.py > train_full.log 2>&1\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "ade1ad39e36c5a04c96e7c4c67723f1b8cfa4c2dd2eba97450f4509b47cd4267",
      "target": "你需要掌握的三种重定向：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0047",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: Piping and redirects"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "82168f99e3951fb103ffaacdcbc0d93acf39c083dc87cee3b52fe3ff7bfada51",
      "target": "| 符号 | 作用 |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `>` | 将标准输出（stdout）写入文件（覆盖原内容） |\n| `>>` | 将标准输出追加到文件末尾 |\n| `2>` | 将标准错误（stderr）写入文件 |\n| `2>&1` | 将标准错误发送到与标准输出相同的目的地 |\n| `\\|` | 将一个命令的标准输出作为下一个命令的标准输入（stdin） |\n"
    },
    {
