        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "1a6174299307ae014b8acaac0b177aaea37ca2a42214e5dcebbc260c9024023f",
      "target": "### 步骤 3：后台进程\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "d684e4c3a33dee1dd6aed6523156d619620a32f2e25c8a7f49d53e8af9379106",
      "target": "训练往往要运行数小时。你不会想在这段时间里一直开着终端。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0053",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "26d734da2edd4da31e49cc0658629300466e1fcf6d02d0dabf6d666537331b82",
      "target": "```bash\n# Run in background (output still goes to terminal)\npython train.py &\n\n# Run in background, immune to hangup (closing terminal won't kill it)\nnohup python train.py > train.log 2>&1 &\n\n# Check what's running in background\njobs\nps aux | grep train.py\n\n# Bring a background job to foreground\nfg %1\n\n# Kill a background process\nkill %1\n# or find its PID and kill that\nkill $(pgrep -f \"train.py\")\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "eaa7716cf1849dd85e10aa1ed61da4f7718856461634b1edf3bd1e58fa76f62f",
      "target": "`&`、`nohup` 与 `screen`/`tmux` 的区别：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0057",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "1734d1b12e8f508a7d558fe9b2f18e40acd1d800c4786a99f66a482df3973abe",
      "target": "| 方法 | 关闭终端后仍能运行？ | 可以重新连接？ |\n|--------|-------------------------|---------------|\n| `command &` | 否 | 否 |\n| `nohup command &` | 是 | 否（查看日志文件） |\n| `screen` / `tmux` | 是 | 是 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "bccd0168f19f6c200c2cfa5f777ad0da3cb391fb5bc29a4ef9487b5f9f340e50",
      "target": "只要任务需要运行几分钟以上，就使用 tmux。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 3: Background processes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "662a6b7453bd6870d1458a5bb82e9fb42ed04cbb7e392f6004a1ef6b5484d0f2",
      "target": "### 步骤 4：tmux\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "46d469b7b4e41e4469e825bd3d06a1057057ec2156c6a2e465679b41e76186a9",
      "target": "tmux 让你能够创建含有多个窗格、可持续运行的终端会话。在管理训练任务时，它是最有用的工具。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0065",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "b1885eff3105b958c2e44ca9a34c19af6cd08b823d9da372e23c3600a82b5c02",
      "target": "```bash\n# Install\n# macOS\nbrew install tmux\n# Ubuntu\nsudo apt install tmux\n\n# Start a named session\ntmux new -s training\n\n# Split horizontally\n# Ctrl+B then \"\n\n# Split vertically\n# Ctrl+B then %\n\n# Navigate between panes\n# Ctrl+B then arrow keys\n\n# Detach (session keeps running)\n# Ctrl+B then d\n\n# Reattach\ntmux attach -t training\n\n# List sessions\ntmux ls\n\n# Kill a session\ntmux kill-session -t training\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "3639db82f2b3a00c3aaad428c32be24804ae940d6291964366ebc0d57d71aa86",
      "target": "一个典型的 AI 工作流会话：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0068",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 34,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0069",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "47789dad21d424be562cd12719918d4502ba288199650e53f70c4e5b2d9b8a1c",
      "target": "```bash\ntmux new -s train\n\n# Pane 1: start training\npython train.py --epochs 100 --lr 1e-4\n\n# Ctrl+B, \" to split, then run GPU monitor\nwatch -n1 nvidia-smi\n\n# Ctrl+B, % to split vertically, tail the logs\ntail -f logs/experiment.log\n\n# Now detach with Ctrl+B, d\n# SSH out, go get coffee, come back\n# tmux attach -t train\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0070",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 4: tmux"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "a95b9c6ac1115a3a3a3fa9ee99ef4593b17ffd098b2b83ebacc27a5f4895f415",
      "target": "### 步骤 5：使用 htop 和 nvtop 进行监控\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0073",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "73b43d8ae2671fdd43b1e97f102f710b3d9d64820b3eb89ca471370beca04323",
      "target": "```bash\n# System processes (better than top)\nhtop\n\n# GPU processes (if you have NVIDIA GPU)\n# Install: sudo apt install nvtop (Ubuntu) or brew install nvtop (macOS)\nnvtop\n\n# Quick GPU check without nvtop\nnvidia-smi\n\n# Watch GPU usage update every second\nwatch -n1 nvidia-smi\n\n# See which processes are using the GPU\nnvidia-smi --query-compute-apps=pid,name,used_memory --format=csv\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0074",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "e99a629386e76d0bcda58bc49e2388671350e7b7fd8853f967acfc2eacbbb6b0",
      "target": "你会用到的 `htop` 快捷键：\n- `F6` 或 `>`：按列排序（按内存排序可查找内存泄漏）\n- `F5`：切换树状视图（查看子进程）\n- `F9`：终止进程\n- `/`：搜索进程名\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 5: Monitoring with htop and nvtop"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "b082f1879dd3f060cc14720c75920dd9958df124d08aeb6e584d57a5fa879ece",
      "target": "### 步骤 6：通过 SSH 连接远程 GPU 机器\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0078",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "cfab24c77d4fa8e044b01e17a0e7a219f9959f8877b759eef03c8476475f9c7a",
      "target": "租用云端 GPU（Lambda、RunPod、Vast.ai）时，你会通过 SSH 连接。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0080",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0081",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "ae8486d7c74d6381a8112d0988cd7a8429802d47050bb6f12e4c102296c59dab",
      "target": "```bash\n# Basic connection\nssh user@gpu-box-ip\n\n# With a specific key\nssh -i ~/.ssh/my_gpu_key user@gpu-box-ip\n\n# Copy files to remote\nscp model.pt user@gpu-box-ip:~/models/\n\n# Copy files from remote\nscp user@gpu-box-ip:~/results/metrics.json ./\n\n# Sync a whole directory (faster for many files)\nrsync -avz ./data/ user@gpu-box-ip:~/data/\n\n# Port forward (access remote Jupyter/TensorBoard locally)\nssh -L 8888:localhost:8888 user@gpu-box-ip\n# Now open localhost:8888 in your browser\n\n# SSH config for convenience\n# Add to ~/.ssh/config:\n# Host gpu\n#     HostName 192.168.1.100\n#     User ubuntu\n#     IdentityFile ~/.ssh/gpu_key\n#\n# Then just:\n# ssh gpu\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0082",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 6: SSH for remote GPU boxes"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "d14aa4f21bb9d3d4022246ad50ce387be1d1a0e92c2072e36a9f837e21e67cac",
      "target": "### 步骤 7：AI 工作中实用的别名\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0084",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 43,
      "source_sha256": "f7947102f5bc0aa4450eecb54fd350f4057633eeac6b773fa9a70b6eb3e5b6e7",
      "target": "将以下内容添加到你的 `~/.bashrc` 或 `~/.zshrc` 中：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0086",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 43,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0087",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 44,
      "source_sha256": "efab979b0b64c8bcf3a96d6c1d9553b2387a9cee19425895f0778617a353c3d3",
      "target": "```bash\nsource phases/00-setup-and-tooling/10-terminal-and-shell/code/shell_aliases.sh\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0088",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 44,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "4bde4be52a1eb7d7d3bf0ff8d396a5b901be6dbec830522ecd945761fbad9f0e",
      "target": "也可以只复制你需要的别名（alias）。主要别名如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0090",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0091",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 46,
      "source_sha256": "380e1f24553da66a04578b93894ac4879a1ee8874da052cc2947670b3f32d45b",
      "target": "```bash\n# GPU status at a glance\nalias gpu='nvidia-smi --query-gpu=index,name,utilization.gpu,memory.used,memory.total,temperature.gpu --format=csv,noheader'\n\n# Kill all Python training processes\nalias killtraining='pkill -f \"python.*train\"'\n\n# Quick virtual environment activate\nalias ae='source .venv/bin/activate'\n\n# Watch training loss\nalias watchloss='tail -f logs/*.log | grep --line-buffered \"loss\"'\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0092",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 46,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-10:b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Terminal & Shell",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 7: Useful aliases for AI work"
      ],
      "ordinal": 47,
      "source_sha256": "7ea66af2d8b991d56bc45f52eef2fc73935cad0775e969886c5109cfb927c957",
      "target": "完整的别名集合见 `code/shell_aliases.sh`。\n"
    },
    {
